#: tformabouttrayslate.lblabout.caption
msgid ""
"Trayslate is a tray-based client for translation services. You can enter text directly, translate clipboard content, or translate selected text in any application. You can also replace text in another app with its translation using a hotkey. The app lets you choose and fully configure the translation service you use.\n"
"\n"
"This application uses third-party resources under the following licenses:\n"
"\n"
"1.  Main icon designed by Flaticon\n"
"     https://www.flaticon.com/ru/free-icon/translator_682045\n"
"\n"
"2.  Dark theme support modules from Double Commander\n"
"     Modules used: udarkstyle.pas, uimport.pas, uwin32widgetsetdark.pas\n"
"     License: GNU General Public License v2.0 (GPL-2.0)\n"
"     https://github.com/doublecmd/doublecmd\n"
"   \n"
"3.  OpenSSL libraries (32-bit and 64-bit versions)\n"
"     OpenSSL 1.1.x\n"
"     License: OpenSSL License + Original SSLeay License\n"
"     OpenSSL 3.x\n"
"     License: Apache License 2.0\n"
"     https://www.openssl.org\n"
"\n"
"4.  Synapse networking library (laz_synapse / synapse41.0)   \n"
"     License: BSD-style license\n"
"     Copyright (c) 1999–2024, Lukas Gebauer\n"
"     https://github.com/geby/synapse\n"
"\n"
"5.  FineWeb2 language data used to generate language profiles\n"
"     License: Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0 (ODC-By)\n"
"     FineWeb2 is sourced from Common Crawl and is also subject to\n"
"     Common Crawl's Terms of Use.   \n"
"     https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-2\n"
"     https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/"
msgstr "Trayslate е базиран трей клиент за преводачески услуги. Може да се въвежда текста директно, да превежда съдържанието на клипборда или да превежда избран текст във всяко приложение. Може също да заменя текста в друго приложение с неговия превод с клавишна комбинация. Приложението позволява да изберете и напълно конфигурирате услугата за превод, която използвате\n\nТова приложение използва ресурси на трети страни съгласно следните лицензи:\n\n1.  Основна икона, проектирана от Flaticon\n     https://www.flaticon.com/ru/free-icon/translator_682045\n\n2.  Модули за поддръжка на тъмна тема от Double Commander\n     Използвани модули: udarkstyle.pas, uimport.pas, uwin32widgetsetdark.pas\n     License: GNU General Public License v2.0 (GPL-2.0)\n     https://github.com/doublecmd/doublecmd\n   \n3.  OpenSSL libraries (32-bit and 64-bit versions)\n     OpenSSL 1.1.x\n     License: OpenSSL License + Original SSLeay License\n     OpenSSL 3.x\n     License: Apache License 2.0\n     https://www.openssl.org\n\n4.  Synapse networking library (laz_synapse / synapse41.0)   \n     License: BSD-style license\n     Copyright (c) 1999–2024, Lukas Gebauer\n     https://github.com/geby/synapse\n\n5.  FineWeb2 езикови данни, използвани за генериране на езикови профили\n     License: Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0 (ODC-By)\n     FineWeb2 is sourced from Common Crawl and is also subject to\n     Common Crawl's Terms of Use.   \n     https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-2\n     https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/"

